{#- The proof: the same text for every certificate of a safety property, and
    for every certificate of a Büchi one. What changes with the module and
    the certificate is in `Data.lean.j2` (the definitions) and
    `_tactics.lean.j2` (the budgets and tactics read off their shape), so a
    certificate can be rewritten without this file. A `--cert-file`
    certificate inlines all three, the module too: the tactics first, so
    that its budgets are in force for the module, as they are for the
    proof. -#}
import Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Fin
import Relational.Basic
